{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道場僧集，先禮三寶，次浴佛像，互跪燒香，各有偈辭，附于卷末。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至此或陳敘，或宣疏，稱佛等以臨時自裁，然後禮讚唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下皆\n例此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下皆例此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至此復跪，秉鑪運想，披陳五悔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘皆例此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "右旋道場，稱釋迦佛號，或諷安樂行品，盡誠而退。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "1070c1201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_1070c1201", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
